        },
        {
          "text": " yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, ogu nigwo mwanya gw'ekitebe kyangye ky'obukama, kandi ahu nta ebigyere byangye, ahu ndituura ahagati y'abantu ba Israeli ebiro byona. Kandi ab'enju ya Israeli n'abagabe baabo tibarigaruka kusiisisa eiziina ryangye eririkwera obwamaraaya bwabo, nari emitumbi y'abagabe baabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
