              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'obu kwakuba okuhikaanisa ekisasi kyabo n'ekyangye, n'enyomyo zaabo n'ezangye; ahagati yangye nabo hakabaho ekisiika kyonka. Ahabw'okuba bakasiisisa eiziina ryangye eririkwera ebihagaro byabo ebi baakozire; nikyo naabamariireho, mbainiire ekiniga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu hati baanyihe omumaisho okuramya ebishushani kwabo n'emitumbi y'abagabe baabo, babite hare, mbone kuguma omuribo ebiro byona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.9"
            ]
