                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku baraakwatwe enshoni ahabw'ebyo byona ebi baakozire, oboorekye enyombekyere ya hekalu, obushohorero bwayo n'obutaahiro bwayo n'oku eyemi kwona; obamanyise emigyenzo yaayo yoona, n'ebiragiro byayo byona; kandi obihandiikye nibakureeba, babone kurinda n'okuhitsya ebiragiro byayo byona, n'emigyenzo yaayo yoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
