        {
          "text": " Oru nirwo rugyero rw'eitambiro, nk'oku mikono yaaryo eri, (buri mukono gurimu mukono gumwe n'ekita). Ekitebe kyaryo, obwemi bwakyo buryaba mukono gumwe, obukiika bwakyo mukono gumwe, n'omugoma gwakyo gube ekita kimwe okwehinguririza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
