        {
          "text": " Kandi otware aha shagama yaayo, ogite ahari ago mahembe ana g'eitambiro n'aha nshonda ina z'omukugiro, n'aha muguno oguryehinguririize; okwo nikwo oririshemeza, okaririhiirira. ",
